   {
    "title": "Bias Bars",
    "description": "• Developed a data analytics platform using Python that analyzes data from RateMyProfessors.com to reveal and visually represent hidden gender biases within student reviews\n• Programmed a search function that quantifies gender-based differences in the frequency of user-defined keywords across all professor reviews\n• Plotted the frequency of searched words across gender and review rating categories, revealing significant disparities in the use of terms like \"intelligent\" and \"genius\" favoring male professors",
    "dateRange": {},
    "associatedWith": ""
   },
   {
    "title": "GrubTrackr",
    "description": "• Developed a location-based restaurant recommendation platform using React and Express.js that displays detailed restaurant information, customer reviews, and location markers to facilitate user restaurant selection\n• Leveraged Redux Toolkit to manage application state and display each restaurant’s image, address, phone number, rating, and fetched Yelp reviews when a user clicks on a restaurant card\n• Rendered UI components dynamically using React Router in response to user interaction to enhance navigation and improve user experience",
